{"availability":"available","full":"NoGod3524/betterhuskyct","name":"betterhuskyct","description":"Turn your HuskyCT / Blackboard ICS calendar into a clean, private deadline dashboard — rolling 7-day view, completion tracking, workload insights, and an English/中文 toggle. Next.js 16 · TypeScript · Tailwind CSS.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-02T02:09:10Z","updated":"2026-10-12T00:32:37Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://huskypilot.vercel.app","topics":["icalendar","nextjs","productivity","student","tailwindcss","typescript","uconn","vercel"],"demo":"https://betterhuskyct.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:39.810Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:39.810Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:39.810Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:45:47.453Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:05:27.313Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T00:24:39.223Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T07:59:39.810Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Your course deadlines, organized. Press Sync and your HuskyCT deadlines, announcements, course files and grades arrive in one calm, ordered view of what's due next.","Students track deadlines across an LMS, a syllabus, and email. BetterHuskyCT turns what HuskyCT already shows you into a single rolling 7-day list, so \"what's due next\" is one glance instead of a scavenger hunt.","It is deliberately small and privacy-first: no NetID, no password, no account, and nothing leaves your browser except what you ask an AI model to read."],"features":["Courses named for you — a Blackboard feed titles a class meeting Environmental Science and never says which course it is, so the app looks the title up in UConn's public course catalogue and fills in NRE 1000E itself.…","Several calendars, several courses — HuskyCT has a feed per course, and a sync brings them all; file each under a course (code plus LEC / DIS / LAB / SEM), and every task shows its course, whether it is a class meeting…","Rolling 7-day view — Today / Tomorrow / This week, grouped and time-sorted","Due-soon reminders — an in-app banner for anything due in the next 24 hours, plus optional browser notifications while the app is open","Works on a phone — below 1024 px a bar along the bottom reaches every page (four main ones, and a More sheet with the rest), buttons and the completion checkbox are finger-sized on a touch screen, and the header fits…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoGod3524/betterhuskyct/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d701fff674087cc996acec2dd293fc79b6d240e03e0759515d20337066dbadd5","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:39.918Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:39.918Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Your course deadlines, organized. Press Sync and your HuskyCT deadlines, announcements, course files and grades arrive in one calm, ordered view of what's due next.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoGod3524/betterhuskyct/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"It is deliberately small and privacy-first: no NetID, no password, no account, and nothing leaves your browser except what you ask an AI model to read.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoGod3524/betterhuskyct/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"Privacy by design — no NetID, no password, no account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoGod3524/betterhuskyct/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"d701fff674087cc996acec2dd293fc79b6d240e03e0759515d20337066dbadd5","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoGod3524/betterhuskyct/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:39.919Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T00:32:37Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoGod3524/betterhuskyct/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:39.